}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

params:query {
  query: john
}

docs {
  # Search Users
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/users/search`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Query Parameters)
  
  ```typescript
  interface SearchUsersQuery {
    query: string;  // Required - Kata kunci pencarian
  }
  ```
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Validation |
  |-------|------|----------|------------|
  | query | string | ✅ | Min 2 karakter |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mencari users",
    "data": [
      {
        "name": "Dr. Ahmad Fauzi",
        "nidn": "0123456789",
        "email": "ahmad@university.ac.id",
        "institusi": "Institut Teknologi Indonesia",
        "prodi": "Teknik Informatika",
        "role": "dosen"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  **Note:** 
  - Max 10 results returned
  - User yang sedang login tidak termasuk dalam hasil
  - Pencarian berdasarkan: name, nidn, email
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Code | Message |
  |--------|------|---------|  
  | 400 | BAD_REQUEST | Query minimal 2 karakter |
  | 401 | UNAUTHORIZED | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | FORBIDDEN | Role tidak diizinkan |
  
  ### Error Example
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Query minimal 2 karakter"
  }
  ```
}
